  "id": "dill-cucumber-dip",
  "name": "Dill Cucumber Dip",
  "subtitle": "A cool, tangy dip with fresh cucumber and dill",
  "description": "Blend softened cream cheese with mayonnaise, lemon, dill, and hot pepper sauce, then fold in chopped cucumber for an easy savory dip.",
